<DIV class="con">
<P class="tit">督导线上听课操作指南</P>
<P class="zd"><SPAN>2022-12-09&nbsp;&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN>审核人：<!--</SPAN><span style="color:red;">审核人参数配置未打开</span><SPAN>-->&nbsp;&nbsp;(已浏览<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1070628979, 12353)</script>)</SPAN></P>
         <div id="vsb_content" class="ny"><div class="v_news_content">
<style><!--  /* Font Definitions */  @font-face {font-family:宋体; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:黑体; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"Cambria Math"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:仿宋_GB2312;} @font-face {font-family:"\@宋体"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@黑体"; panose-1:2 1 6 9 6 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@仿宋_GB2312";}  /* Style Definitions */  p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";} a:link, span.MsoHyperlink {color:blue; text-decoration:underline;} a:visited, span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed {color:#954F72; text-decoration:underline;} p.MsoAcetate, li.MsoAcetate, div.MsoAcetate {mso-style-link:"批注框文本 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";} p.cm2, li.cm2, div.cm2 {mso-style-name:cm2; margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;} span.UnresolvedMention {mso-style-name:"Unresolved Mention"; color:#605E5C; background:#E1DFDD;} span.Char {mso-style-name:"批注框文本 Char"; mso-style-link:批注框文本; font-family:"Times New Roman","serif";}  /* Page Definitions */  @page Section1 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:72.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 90.0pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section1 {page:Section1;} --></style>
<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 31.6pt;"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">学在西电听课途径一</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">打开学校官网首页，点击智课平台<span lang="EN-US"><a href="http://xdspoc.xidian.edu.cn/"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312; font-size: 20px;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;">http://xdspoc.xidian.edu.cn/</span></span></a></span>，统一身份认证账号登录</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;"><img width="554" height="151" id="图片 7" src="/__local/D/60/C8/C750761114555480BCA126D0679_E84B8BF4_24C24.png" border="0" vwidth="554" vheight="151" vurl="/_vsl/D60C8C750761114555480BCA126D0679/E84B8BF4/24C24" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/D/60/C8/C750761114555480BCA126D0679_E84B8BF4_24C24.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;"><img width="553" height="93" id="图片 5" alt="1669367237659" src="/__local/1/6B/C5/025CE890751B6959498DA108B4C_9A68A40A_780E.png" border="0" vwidth="553" vheight="93" vurl="/_vsl/16BC5025CE890751B6959498DA108B4C/9A68A40A/780E" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/1/6B/C5/025CE890751B6959498DA108B4C_9A68A40A_780E.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">进入“应用中心”点击“录直播课程”</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;"><img width="554" height="283" id="图片 8" src="/__local/5/36/FF/D8E16ACE86D539529390EBDB3BA_FF51F41F_1521E.png" border="0" vwidth="554" vheight="283" vurl="/_vsl/536FFD8E16ACE86D539529390EBDB3BA/FF51F41F/1521E" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/5/36/FF/D8E16ACE86D539529390EBDB3BA_FF51F41F_1521E.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">点击“督导评课”，按条件筛选所需课程即可</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;"><img width="553" height="216" id="图片 3" alt="1669367379507" src="/__local/6/89/36/D8C6D58004BA92BF0E3B9DA151E_6F95AC0E_D09B.png" border="0" vwidth="553" vheight="216" vurl="/_vsl/68936D8C6D58004BA92BF0E3B9DA151E/6F95AC0E/D09B" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/6/89/36/D8C6D58004BA92BF0E3B9DA151E_6F95AC0E_D09B.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 31.6pt;"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;"><br></span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 31.6pt;"><strong><span style="letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">学在西电听课途径二</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">通过网址</span><span lang="EN-US"><a href="https://learning.xidian.edu.cn"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">https://learning.xidian.edu.cn</span></a></span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">进入“学在西电”，统一身份认证账号登录，点击“教学督导”模块</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;"><img width="553" height="265" id="图片 2" alt="1669367445515" src="/__local/6/01/54/C877FE96A97884F3368A70BD464_1E8674E1_2465C.png" border="0" vwidth="553" vheight="265" vurl="/_vsl/60154C877FE96A97884F3368A70BD464/1E8674E1/2465C" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/6/01/54/C877FE96A97884F3368A70BD464_1E8674E1_2465C.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">点击“督导评课”，按条件筛选所需课程即可</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;"><img width="552" height="237" id="图片 1" alt="1669367537599" src="/__local/B/E7/DF/74D4AD5E82E38B68C2D2BC80079_5EB17F22_C96C.png" border="0" vwidth="552" vheight="237" vurl="/_vsl/BE7DF74D4AD5E82E38B68C2D2BC80079/5EB17F22/C96C" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/B/E7/DF/74D4AD5E82E38B68C2D2BC80079_5EB17F22_C96C.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;"><br></span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">智课平台授课听课指南</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 150%;"><span style="line-height: 150%; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">手机端下载“学在西电”<span lang="EN-US">APP</span>并登录</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;"><img width="253" height="190" id="图片 9" src="/__local/3/6B/39/4891FCF3D44F8A5698DD30FD963_BD6D36CA_32D1.jpg" border="0" vwidth="253" vheight="190" vurl="/_vsl/36B394891FCF3D44F8A5698DD30FD963/BD6D36CA/32D1" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/3/6B/39/4891FCF3D44F8A5698DD30FD963_BD6D36CA_32D1.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 150%;"><span style="line-height: 150%; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">浏览器打开网址<span lang="EN-US">https://data.chaoxing.com</span>，使用“学在西电”手机<span lang="EN-US">APP</span>扫码登录，点击“大数据分析平台”</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 150%;"><strong><span style="color: rgb(192, 0, 0); line-height: 150%; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">（注意：无需账号密码，直接扫码登录）</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US"><img width="492" height="264" id="图片 12" alt="1641798264(1)" src="/__local/E/51/CB/6AAF7DD6B3F65D2FD5392ECA580_ED9E8F34_CBB5.png" border="0" vwidth="492" vheight="264" vurl="/_vsl/E51CB6AAF7DD6B3F65D2FD5392ECA580/ED9E8F34/CBB5" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/E/51/CB/6AAF7DD6B3F65D2FD5392ECA580_ED9E8F34_CBB5.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US"><img width="517" height="222" id="图片 13" alt="1641798109(1)" src="/__local/7/CE/92/D2E982987C857B00C3A4D5E5EA7_79B2AD1C_2102C.png" border="0" vwidth="517" vheight="222" vurl="/_vsl/7CE92D2E982987C857B00C3A4D5E5EA7/79B2AD1C/2102C" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/7/CE/92/D2E982987C857B00C3A4D5E5EA7_79B2AD1C_2102C.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 150%;"><span style="line-height: 150%; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">进入“在线督导”模块，点击【直播课堂】即可看到直播中的课程</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US"><img width="554" height="265" id="图片 14" src="/__local/5/FE/6E/BAD5ACDB3BA2DC56C5D09F0F659_02E79823_A443.png" border="0" vwidth="554" vheight="265" vurl="/_vsl/5FE6EBAD5ACDB3BA2DC56C5D09F0F659/02E79823/A443" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/5/FE/6E/BAD5ACDB3BA2DC56C5D09F0F659_02E79823_A443.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 150%;"><span style="line-height: 150%; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">可根据上课时段、学院名称及教师姓名工号等筛选项搜索课程。点击课程进入直播并加入课堂，即可进入听课界面</span><strong><span style="color: rgb(192, 0, 0); line-height: 150%; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">（注意：<span lang="EN-US">PC</span>端需下载安装超星课堂软件，系统会自动提示）</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US"><img width="554" height="290" id="图片 10" src="/__local/5/56/9B/4CD2EE64ABEF29F30669ADAEC9C_2A9D877D_14757.png" border="0" vwidth="554" vheight="290" vurl="/_vsl/5569B4CD2EE64ABEF29F30669ADAEC9C/2A9D877D/14757" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/5/56/9B/4CD2EE64ABEF29F30669ADAEC9C_2A9D877D_14757.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US"><img width="554" height="311" id="图片 11" src="/__local/A/ED/DA/4104903930AA1D26E4921398F1A_18C3B1C7_13F41.png" border="0" vwidth="554" vheight="311" vurl="/_vsl/AEDDA4104903930AA1D26E4921398F1A/18C3B1C7/13F41" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/A/ED/DA/4104903930AA1D26E4921398F1A_18C3B1C7_13F41.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US"><img width="545" height="252" id="图片 15" alt="1641798842(1)" src="/__local/7/7F/30/3FEE4C0C7B30CEBE8502F169CA6_F54EB9BF_5015.png" border="0" vwidth="545" vheight="252" vurl="/_vsl/77F303FEE4C0C7B30CEBE8502F169CA6/F54EB9BF/5015" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/7/7F/30/3FEE4C0C7B30CEBE8502F169CA6_F54EB9BF_5015.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center;"><span lang="EN-US"><img width="554" height="292" id="图片 16" alt="1641798876(1)" src="/__local/5/64/AE/ACD69304ADCB03080E1D6C31FE0_9BE7F471_14E93.png" border="0" vwidth="554" vheight="292" vurl="/_vsl/564AEACD69304ADCB03080E1D6C31FE0/9BE7F471/14E93" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/5/64/AE/ACD69304ADCB03080E1D6C31FE0_9BE7F471_14E93.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 150%;"><span style="line-height: 150%; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">如无法加入课堂，可通过复制<span lang="EN-US">---</span>输入课程码的方式进入。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: center; line-height: 150%;"><span lang="EN-US" style="line-height: 150%; font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;"><img width="554" height="298" id="图片 4" src="/__local/1/A9/B3/9AEF3329314119E4DD17737EB44_5AEE5B19_C8D3.png" border="0" vwidth="554" vheight="298" vurl="/_vsl/1A9B39AEF3329314119E4DD17737EB44/5AEE5B19/C8D3" vsbhref="vurl" orisrc="/__local/1/A9/B3/9AEF3329314119E4DD17737EB44_5AEE5B19_C8D3.png" class="img_vsb_content"></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 16pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div></DIV>
   
    
